 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Are wa Senkō, Bokura no Shinjū"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "Flash and Die (with us)"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Shima Yuki, 15, attends a junior high school attached to a music college. His life, which had been all about piano, takes a dark turn, and he runs away from home on his bicycle on a winter night. He gets lost and is chased by a delinquent, where he encounters Miroku, a 25-year-old host who shines brightly in the night sky. He clings to the drunk Miroku and tumbles into his room, where he finds himself... A heart-warming original novel woven by two people with their own problems and nowhere to go."
  },
